  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation visit of the CEO to Beira for assignment as the new Chair of Board SDUB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main ambition of this short-term assignment of the proposed new Chair of Board is to discuss and agree on all conditions of the appointment of the new CEO and Chair of Board, the financial conditions and the business plan for 2023-2024, during a visit of 5 to 6 days to Beira.The business plan is focused on delivering a proof of concept for the Maraza project within the constraints of the limited financial budget.</narrative>
  </description>
